    <title>坐忘道</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/%E5%9D%90%E5%BF%98%E9%81%93</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/%E5%9D%90%E5%BF%98%E9%81%93</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 身心放松的过程就是忘记分别烦恼的过程，先忘了再说——由《道诡异仙》的坐忘道想到庄子的坐忘与《黄帝内经》的上古天真论。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>观物</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/%E8%A7%82%E7%89%A9</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E4%BA%BA%E7%94%9F%E6%84%9F%E6%82%9F/%E8%A7%82%E7%89%A9</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 先护经脉五脏玄明免受干扰，再观天地阴阳万象以察其势；察势须先博学，知过去未来方能运作。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>葱油</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%91%B1%E6%B2%B9</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%91%B1%E6%B2%B9</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 食用油 200g 冷油下葱姜八角花椒桂皮香叶，小火慢熬 10 分钟，葱浅金黄立刻关火，浸凉后滤渣。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>葱油面</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%91%B1%E6%B2%B9%E9%9D%A2</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%91%B1%E6%B2%B9%E9%9D%A2</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 碗底先用葱油、生抽、老抽、白糖调好酱汁，碱水面煮到八分熟，舀两勺面汤化开酱汁，捞面拌匀。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>蒜蓉蒸茄子</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E8%92%B8%E8%8C%84%E5%AD%90</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E8%92%9C%E8%93%89%E8%92%B8%E8%8C%84%E5%AD%90</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 长茄子一分为二蒸 10–12 分钟，蒜蓉分两份——一份生蒸入味，一份炒香泼油，蒜香层次更足。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>清净经</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E9%81%93%E6%B3%95/%E6%B8%85%E5%87%80%E7%BB%8F</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E9%81%93%E6%B3%95/%E6%B8%85%E5%87%80%E7%BB%8F</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 《太上老君说常清静经》全文——大道无形无情无名，人能常清静，天地悉皆归。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>凉拌莴笋</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%87%89%E6%8B%8C%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%87%89%E6%8B%8C%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 莴笋切丝糖腌出水，热油泼蒜末小米辣，拌生抽凉拌汁——清爽爽脆的一道凉菜。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>地三鲜</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%89%E9%B2%9C</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%89%E9%B2%9C</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 土豆、茄子、青椒分次过油，茄子裹淀粉防吸油，最后用生抽蚝油料汁烧开出锅。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>干煸四季豆（清淡）</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%B9%B2%E7%85%B8%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E8%B1%86%EF%BC%88%E6%B8%85%E6%B7%A1%EF%BC%89</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%B9%B2%E7%85%B8%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E8%B1%86%EF%BC%88%E6%B8%85%E6%B7%A1%EF%BC%89</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 四季豆煸到干瘪，只放盐和少许味精，不加重口调料，突出豆角本身的清甜。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>木耳炒莴笋</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E6%9C%A8%E8%80%B3%E7%82%92%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E6%9C%A8%E8%80%B3%E7%82%92%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 木耳焯水、莴笋片大火快炒，加水焖一分钟调味，最后水淀粉勾芡挂汁。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
